方案、知情同意书及其他相关文件提交伦理委员会审查的安排，研究过程中方案修订与相关研究信息的伦理审查要求，研究中心与伦理委员会之间的沟通及文件往来管理，以及伦理委员会对研究实施的监督职责。伦理委员会可要求终止研究，并可基于安全性、监管或其他原因要求受试者退出研究。各研究中心按照所在机构伦理委员会的现行规定组织实施上述审查工作。","rationale":"依据已确认研究设计信息：中国、多中心、III期、成人中重度斑块状银屑病、年龄≥18岁。医学作者需核对：本研究伦理审查的提交材料与流程、安全性信息向伦理委员会报告的范围与要求，以及伦理委员会要求终止研究或要求受试者退出研究的相关表述是否纳入及如何表述。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","section_number":"11.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:87b90b572171e110cee6e00f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033056_780b10f3","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:87b90b572171e110cee6e00f","quote":"章节编号=11.4\n章节标题=保密与隐私","quote_sha256":"38c277115f5bddc4743f51c6e0ff9573966762a297b889d2b2bf4363309c0761","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:87b90b572171e110cee6e00f","span_id":"es_sec_11_4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_pj_phase"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_pj_