81210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_pj_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"年龄≥18岁","quote_sha256":"0c3d8a2b0618e777b6c9d5932b5271d28b4bcce906ff03ae3a5294d59ff9147c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_pj_age"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_pj_periods"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_sec_11_5","es_pj_phase","es_pj_area","es_pj_multicenter","es_pj_population","es_pj_age","es_pj_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"保险与赔偿","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心III期临床研究，拟入组年龄≥18岁的成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，研究实施期间涵盖筛选期（最长4周）、治疗期（16周）和安全性随访期（4周）。本研究的保险与赔偿工作涵盖研究相关保险的保障范围与保障对象，受试者因参加本研究而发生损害时的医学处理与赔偿途径，相关申请、评估与处理环节的衔接，以及受试者及其法定代理人在上述事项中的知情安排。上述内容的落实应覆盖受试者参加研究的完整过程，并与研究知情同意文件中的相应说明保持一致，确保受试者能够清晰了解保险与赔偿的基本安排。","rationale":"依据已确认研究设计信息：中国、多中心、III期、成人中重度斑块状银屑病、年龄≥18岁，筛选期最长4周、治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周。医学作者需核对：本研究保险的投保与覆盖范围、受试者损害医学处理与赔偿的具体途径，以及上述内容与知情同意文件的衔接。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cb95bcbc11a174bb","section_number":"11.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:87b90b572171e110cee6e00f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c